The Example Manual 1.0, as kept in the cosmoes.org library
==========================================================

This folder is a copy of The Example Manual 1.0, kept at
https://cosmoes.org/library/example/manual/1.0/, not the publisher's own page.
The publisher is The Example Society; its own page for this text is https://example.invalid/manual/1.0/
The files under files/ are the publisher's files as they came from https://example.invalid/archives/example-1.0-docs-text.tar.bz2
on 2026-11-18T12:00:00Z (FETCHED, SHA256SUMS). Nothing in them is changed.

Changed in form
---------------
Rendered as HTML from the publisher's plain-text build, by rule: titles from their underlines, paragraphs as paragraphs, indented blocks as preformatted text, anchors from the titles and from the definition lines. No word is changed, and the publisher's file is kept unchanged beside the page.

